# Desktop deployment: the live production database and its nightly
# backups. These hold participant email addresses and the GitHub mirror is
# public, so they must never be committed. The push script also refuses
# outright on any .db file, but that is the backstop — this is the fence.
prisma/backups/
prisma/prod.db
prisma/prod.db-*
prisma/production.db
prisma/production.db-*
